# TabStationToo, the PS2 emulator LootDen serves for playing PS2 games in the browser.
# Built by scripts/build-tabstationtoo.sh and the "PS2 browser emulator" workflow, which
# publishes it as the release asset the Dockerfile downloads. Change the commit to update it.
